//   2. Re-export event record structures and serialization.
//   3. Re-export circular ring buffer and dual ring buffer management.
//   4. Re-export persistent flight log flush and stream formatting.
//   5. Re-export portable flight capsule packing, unpacking, and CRC-32.
//   6. Re-export bounded failed-flight capsule recording.

